# Milestone M0 — Project Bootstrap

TradeArena is a web application for automated stock-picking tournament evaluation based on historical intraday market data.
This plan bootstraps the foundational monorepo architecture for TradeArena according to `tradearena-prd.md` and `tradearena-tech-stack.md`.

## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> Node.js v22.19.0 and npm 10.9.3 are installed. In this Windows environment, npm commands are executed via `cmd /c npm` or `.cmd` wrappers due to PowerShell execution policy.
> Docker CLI is currently not available on this host; `docker-compose.yml` will be provided for containerized deployment/services, while local dev tooling will support both local execution and mock/configured database connections.

